  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "應用文的實用與美感",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICALITY AND AESTHETICS OF PRACTICAL WRITING",
    "describe_ch": "應用文強調實用的價值，而實用性文章一般不具藝術性也成為一種刻板印象。實際上，應用文名篇佳作流傳非常廣泛，閱讀這些優秀的名篇佳作，不僅可作為範例，也可以領略其中的美感。本課程旨在透過名篇佳作以及實際範例的介紹，引導學生欣賞其情意文字的美感，進而掌握應用文體的特性，學習寫作應用文書的格式與技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "Practical writing emphasizes practical value and, as generally not artistic, has become a stereotype. In fact, the famous works of applied literature are widely circulated. Reading these excellent famous works can not only serve as examples for students, but also let students appreciate the beauty in them. This course aims to guide students to appreciate the beauty of their emotional writing through the introduction of famous works and practical examples, master the characteristics of applied style, and learn the format and skills of writing applied documents.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "協助學生熟悉了解應用文格式種類。",
      "describe_en": " Assist students to understand the types of application formats."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": ".協助學生在職場、處事、應試等情境，能做出得體的應對與恰如其分的表達，有效運用應用文解決日常生活的問題。",
      "describe_en": "Assist students in the workplace, in the test and other situations, to make appropriate responses and appropriate expressions, and to effectively apply the application language to solve daily life problems."
    }
  ],
